                                                "sense_id": "2d035eca-f4d4-352d-b85b-6d8f37ef73fc",
                                                "text": "“In the current period, when people are embedded in social and informational bubbles with like-minded friends and relatives,” he says, “the idea of partnering with someone from a different bubble is understandably daunting. At a minimum it’s awkward and complicated.”"
                                            },
